mat typically presents data consistently, and for 1939, they showed individual monthly values. This inconsistency raises questions about how to interpret the 1940 data accurately.\n\nGiven the lack of additional information, I'll proceed with the calculation using the provided value of 990,927, which yields a result of 1.6431.\n","signature":""},{"type":"toolRequest","id":"call_3d9e04fa37914b739fef33e6","toolCall":{"status":"success","value":{"name":"shell","arguments":{"command":"cat /app/answer.txt"}}},"_meta":{"goose_extension":"developer"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
